    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delivery Days </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the simplest encounters can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Delivery Days, a visual novel about chance meetings and unexpected bonds, you play as an overworked man who begins to find warmth and connection through the people who step into his life\u2014one knock at the door at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order food, request help, or simply open the door\u2014and you might find more than you expected waiting on the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your wishlist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mika \u2013 The Food Delivery Girl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, charming, and full of playful energy, Mika is a delivery worker who hides her softer side behind her cap and uniform. When her routine visits turn into something more personal, the line between casual deliveries and heartfelt moments begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860730/extras/a9367369da0eb88cf8a3e35df7802037.avif?t=1755721706\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rika Akiyama \u2013 The Nurse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant, gentle, and carrying the grace of maturity, Akiyama arrives when Yuuto falls ill from overwork. What begins as a professional check-up slowly grows into something warmer, though her past and vulnerabilities may complicate the bond you share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860730/extras/2082df3b2d3e83025f52e33aadc49952.avif?t=1755721706\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern-day romance visual novel with multiple branching routes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience different stories depending on who you open your heart to.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice-of-life warmth mixed with emotional twists.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that determine your relationships and endings.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you keep things casual, or let your heart get carried away with every delivery?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
