i><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern-day romance visual novel with multiple branching routes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience different stories depending on who you open your heart to.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice-of-life warmth mixed with emotional twists.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that determine your relationships and endings.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you keep things casual, or let your heart get carried away with every delivery?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
